# ROM manifest of Ms. Pac-Man with the speedup hack (MAME clone mspacmnf). The layout is
# mspacman.manifest's, see there: pacfast.6f takes the place of pacman.6f, the rest as in
# mspacman. pacfast.6f is not in mspacman.zip and comes from puckman.zip (folder pacmanf).

